/-! ## §4.1  The sector `Θ_j` and adapted symbols -/

/-- The convex annular sector `Θ_j = {ω : 0 < ω₁ < 2^{-10} ω₂, 2^{j-1} ≤ |ω| ≤ 2^{j+1}}`
